OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785383016
OL,3,CScottish animal hospital first in UK
OL,4,Cto offer dogs new sting immunotherapy
OL,6,FA Scottish animal hospital has become
OL,7,Fthe first in the UK to use an
OL,8,Finnovative treatment for dogs
OL,9,Fsuffering serious allergic reactions
OL,10,Fto bee and wasp stings.
OL,12,FThe University of Glasgow's Small
OL,13,FAnimal Hospital has used a treatment
OL,14,Fcalled Hymenoptera Venom Immunotherapy
OL,15,F(Vit), which trains the immune system
OL,16,Fto tolerate future exposure to stings.
OL,18,FThe Small Animal Hospital is one of
OL,19,Fjust a few specialist centres around
OL,20,Fthe world able to deliver this type of
OL,21,Fdisease-modifying treatment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
