FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785383016
OL,3,CScottish animal hospital first in UK
OL,4,Cto offer dogs new sting immunotherapy
OL,6,FThe therapy has now been successfully
OL,7,Fused on a number of patients, with
OL,8,Fclinicians saying it offers a "hopeful
OL,9,Fapproach" to preventing recurrent
OL,10,Fanaphylaxis in dogs.
OL,12,FInsect venom allergy is one of the
OL,13,Fmost serious acute allergic conditions
OL,14,Fin canines.
OL,16,FReactions can develop within minutes
OL,17,Fof a sting and can, in a very small
OL,18,Fnumber of cases, progress from hives
OL,19,Fand vomiting to collapse, respiratory
OL,20,Fdistress, and in severe cases, death.
OL,26,@pD@_OUqD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
