FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785383016
OL,3,CScottish animal hospital first in UK
OL,4,Cto offer dogs new sting immunotherapy
OL,6,FAlmost two-thirds of dogs which
OL,7,Fexperience one severe reaction to a
OL,8,Fbee or wasp sting go on to experience
OL,9,Fthe same, or worse symptoms after
OL,10,Fsubsequent stings.
OL,12,FProfessor Ana Rostaher, who leads the
OL,13,Ftreatment at the hospital, said:
OL,14,F"Venom immunotherapy represents a
OL,15,Fmajor advance in how we can manage
OL,16,Fsevere insect sting allergies in dogs.
OL,18,F"For affected animals, a single sting
OL,19,Fcan make them very ill and even die.
OL,26,@vD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785383016
OL,3,CScottish animal hospital first in UK
OL,4,Cto offer dogs new sting immunotherapy
OL,6,F"However, this treatment offers a
OL,7,Fproactive way to change that risk
OL,8,Fprofile and provides owners with an
OL,9,Foption for further peace of mind for
OL,10,Fthose animals who are severely
OL,11,Fallergic to insect stings."
OL,13,FThe treatment, which was first
OL,14,Fdeveloped for use in humans, works by
OL,15,Fgradually introducing controlled,
OL,16,Fincreasing doses of bee or wasp venom
OL,17,Fto the affected dog, which trains the
OL,18,Fimmune system to tolerate future
OL,19,Fstings.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
