CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785383016
OL,3,CScottish animal hospital first in UK
OL,4,Cto offer dogs new sting immunotherapy
OL,6,FClinicians said doing so can
OL,7,F"significantly reduce" the likelihood
OL,8,Fof a recurrent severe allergic
OL,9,Freaction.
OL,11,FThe treatment involves an initial
OL,12,Fdiagnostic phase with allergy testing,
OL,13,Ffollowed by a closely monitored
OL,14,Finduction period and long-term
OL,15,Fmaintenance therapy that may continue
OL,16,Ffor several years.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
