OL,3,CScottish animal hospital first in UK
OL,4,Cto offer dogs new sting immunotherapy
OL,6,FAmber, a Vizsla breed dog, became the
OL,7,Ffirst subject in the UK to undergo the
OL,8,Ftherapy at the hospital after she
OL,9,Fsuffered a severe allergic reaction to
OL,10,Fa bee sting in 2021.
OL,12,FHer owners, Claire and Matthew Preece,
OL,13,Ffrom Stratford-upon-Avon, said Amber
OL,14,Fbecame "unwell very quickly" following
OL,15,Fthe sting, with sudden behavioural
OL,16,Fchanges followed by the rapid
OL,17,Fdevelopment of hives and vomiting.
OL,26,@vD@HOUvD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785383016
OL,3,CScottish animal hospital first in UK
OL,4,Cto offer dogs new sting immunotherapy
OL,6,FAfter hearing about the groundbreaking
OL,7,Fnew therapy, the couple opted to have
OL,8,FAmber treated at the Small Animal
OL,9,FHospital in Glasgow.
OL,11,FMs Preece said: "Amber became unwell
OL,12,Fvery quickly at home ` we didn't even
OL,13,Frealise at the time that she had been
OL,14,Fstung by a bee that had flown in
OL,15,Fthrough an open window.
OL,17,F"Her behaviour changed first, then
OL,18,Fthings escalated rapidly. It became
OL,19,Fclear within minutes that this was
OL,20,Fextremely serious.
OL,26,@sD@QOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785383016
OL,3,CScottish animal hospital first in UK
OL,4,Cto offer dogs new sting immunotherapy
OL,6,F"We chose immunotherapy to reduce the
OL,7,Frisk of another reaction and to regain
OL,8,Fa sense of control.
OL,10,F"The anxiety never fully went away `
OL,11,Fwe simply wanted to do everything
OL,12,Fpossible to protect Amber."
OL,14,FProf Rostaher said: "Amber's story
OL,15,Funderlines why this treatment matters
OL,16,Fas, for some dogs, these reactions are
OL,17,Fsudden, severe, and deeply distressing
OL,18,Ffor families.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUtD@[O]vD@UOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
