OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785383016
OL,3,CScottish animal hospital first in UK
OL,4,Cto offer dogs new sting immunotherapy
OL,6,F"Venom immunotherapy offers a way not
OL,7,Fjust to treat the condition, but to
OL,8,Fprevent the next emergency before it
OL,9,Fhappens."
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@IO]
